    "reviewed_invariants": [
      "Exactly one qualified MCO record is required only for the four exact names; no qualified record is permitted on any other selection.",
      "Each exact part is tied to its own line; SYSCTRL identity/address/count, GPIOA identity/address/register block, unique PA8, AF4 route, geometry, masks, real RCC gate and policy assertions remain enforced.",
      "PF0/HSE_IN and PF1/HSE_OUT each require one reservation and a bonded identity for all four parts.",
      "F030C8T7 and A030C8T7 require PC14/LSE_IN and PC15/LSE_OUT routes and identities. K8T7 and K8U7 reject either pin identity and reject matching pins or LSE signals anywhere in all peripheral routes.",
      "The actual GPIOA generated policy assertion covers the exact four names, retains Once/None/false readbacks and disallows reset/disable.",
      "All electrical, SOURCE/DIV, register geometry and pad checks are unchanged; generated capability cfg remains mco_f030 and the unchanged rcc module exports only under that cfg."
    ]
